# ==============================================================================
# DOCKER IGNORE CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# --- Host Dependency Isolation ---
**/node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# --- Host Build Artifacts ---
**/dist/
**/build/
.vite/
.cache/

# --- Version Control & Metadata ---
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# --- Environment Variables & Secrets ---
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- Documentation & Tooling Logs ---
*.md
LICENSE
*.log
